      375.12,
      554.73,
      397.19
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by section 6(2)(b) and section 21(2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Ordinance(Chapter 269), I, Patali Champika Ranawaka, Minister of Megapolis and Western Development do by this Order:-",
    "fonts": [
